  "usage": "Play spin_up, then loop hover while the rig flies (spin_down to land it: the rotors only). The spots layer on top: lights_on swings them from rest to flood (every zone of the map lit), flood holds it, show loops a sweep that starts and ends on flood, lights_off returns them to rest. Or drive each spot's pan and tilt directly within range (aim with spot_rule). Put a SpotLight3D on each Spot<Position>Beam gizmo with its cone_half_angle_deg as spot_angle and range_m as its range. The displays and marquees take the game's textures on M_Screen and M_Marquee.",
